{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13341","headline":"秋夜寄皇甫冉郑丰 · 刘方平","name":"秋夜寄皇甫冉郑丰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳清夜白云归，城里长河列宿稀。\n秋後见飞千里鴈，月中闻捣万家衣。\n长怜西雍青门道，久别东吴黄鹄矶。\n借问客书何所寄，用心不啻两乡违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘方平","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}